###Text
Text test::kindlyotter::text::LibraryBranchNotes
{
  type: markdown;
  content: '# Kindly Library Branch Records\n\nThis note documents the branch record set published through the LibraryBranchDataSpace data space. The data space offers two execution contexts over one relational mapping: the primary estate (the default) and the mirror estate. Each estate is reached through its own connection, whose name-rewriting post-processor moves every declared relation onto a different physical schema and table name.\n\n## Record families\n\n- Monthly lending series: one row per branch and year with twelve monthly checkout columns and a declared annual total.\n- Branch service profiles: opening pattern and service tier per branch.\n- Shelved stock: title lines with their reservation queue length.\n- Volunteer periods and the outreach register.\n\nThe featured endpoints of the data space project these records at full width.\n';
}
